	(text
		"J_VALVE1 pin1 +12V_VALVE, pin2 VALVE1_SW (low-side). Flyback cathode to +12V_VALVE."
		(at 16.67 152.415 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d1bfcfce-fead-59e3-a0ca-287175b36db8")
	)
	(text
		"Short-circuit sensing: R_SH1 0.1 ohm 1 W (FOJAN FRM121WFR100TM) sits in the source of Q_V1; the sensed voltage is I x 0.1 ohm, 50 mV at the 0.5 A coil current and 0.15 V at the 1.5 A hold current of F1, read on PA1 through R_IS1 1 k and C_IS1 10 nF. Firmware turns the valve off when the sensed voltage exceeds 0.1 V (1.0 A, twice the coil current); a shorted coil cable then no longer holds the rail across Q_V1 until F1 trips. R_SH1 dissipates 0.225 W at 1.5 A, against its 1 W rating."
		(at 16.67 154.955 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "db4a35c8-be84-5770-8acc-c23fe8c6e34d")
	)
	(text
		"Load: 12 V DC solenoid, coil current at most 0.5 A. AO3400A carries 0.5 A (rated far above, needs datasheet value sourcing for the exact figure), flyback diode 1N5819-class (1 A class), VALVE1_SW is class PWR12 (0.8 mm, about 8x the width a 0.5 A / 10 C rise needs)."
		(at 16.67 157.495 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "39f19cd5-3de7-574f-9af3-d2e6e1bb0d48")
	)
